pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 60, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Cerdeira 2020 — 背景 + 方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 150, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>TrustZone TEE 暴露接口复杂、TCB 变大，真实系统反复出现漏洞</li>
        <li>Trusted application 和 TEE OS 的边界不清晰</li>
        <li>Secure monitor 和 driver 的接口成为攻击入口</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 360, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$border"
  - elementId: section2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 380, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 420, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>按漏洞面、接口、权限边界和实现缺陷建立 taxonomy</li>
        <li>Trusted application and TEE OS attack surface 的系统梳理</li>
        <li>Secure monitor / driver interface risk 的分类</li>
        <li>Vulnerability taxonomy 解释为什么 CCA 需要更强边界</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 660, 1100, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>来源：Cerdeira 2020, DOI: 10.1109/SP40000.2020.00061; local PDF 已核验</p>